# MySQL Connection Examples

## Environment Variables
```bash
DATABASE_URL=mysql://{{.Database.Environment.MYSQL_USER}}:{{.Database.Environment.MYSQL_PASSWORD}}@localhost:{{.Database.Port}}/{{.Database.Environment.MYSQL_DATABASE}}
MYSQL_HOST=localhost
MYSQL_PORT={{.Database.Port}}
MYSQL_DATABASE={{.Database.Environment.MYSQL_DATABASE}}
